# Styles

Tokens live in `src/lib/styles/base/variables.css` and are pulled in by `src/lib/styles/styles.css`, which `+layout.svelte` imports once. Do not add a second global stylesheet under `assets/css/`.

## Look

Brutalist mono, not the old mint/pink theme:

- Paper is `--color-offwhite` / `--color-paper`. Ink is `--color-ink` / `--color-black`
- Borders are thick and black (`--border-width-thick`, `--color-border-primary`)
- Shadows are hard offsets (`--shadow-sm` is `2px 2px 0 black`), not soft blurs
- `--color-secondary` (blue) is for focus and rare emphasis only
- Type uses `--font-display` for UI labels and `--font-primary` for body

## Rules

- Prefer an existing token over a new raw value. Spacing is the `--space-*` scale
- A new color, size, or shadow is added to `variables.css` and then referenced. Do not paste hex into a component
- Component CSS is scoped and nested with the project's PostCSS setup. Class names follow BEM in shared components
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` for anything that animates (see `animations.css`)
- Give images and media a size or `aspect-ratio` so the page does not jump
